B.Zq=new A.hx("Submitting a fraudulently low price is not allowed. It is grounds for removal.")
B.Y3=new A.aZ("A bid is a promise. Bid the real price you will do the job for, including everything you expect the job to need.")
B.Y2=new A.aZ("Not allowed:")
B.a4a=s(["A price you do not intend to honor, to win the job and then raise it after arrival.","Bait-and-switch: a low bid followed by demands for more money, or refusing the agreed work unless the customer pays more.","Leaving out what you know the job needs, then adding it later outside the approval flow.","Bidding on a job you cannot or do not intend to do.","Bidding on a labor-only job and then requiring the customer to buy parts from you, or the reverse.","Asking the customer to pay cash, or to pay anywhere outside YCYC."],t.s)
B.We=new A.dj(B.a4a)
B.Xe=new A.aZ("What you can do: if the job turns out to need more than expected, send an additional work request in the app and let the customer decide. If it is far outside what was posted, it is fine to explain and let the customer cancel.")
B.WN=new A.dM("Repeated complaints, cancelled jobs after low bids, or customers reporting a price change can lead to your account being reviewed, payouts held, suspension or permanent removal.")
B.a5i=s([B.Zq,B.Y3,B.Y2,B.We,B.Xe,B.WN],t.f)
B.V0=new A.b9("m-bidding-honest","Honest bidding: no fraudulent or bait prices","Bid what you will actually do the job for.",B.a5i)
B.Yk=new A.aZ("If the customer switched on 'I have my own parts', the job carries a bold orange flag: LABOR QUOTE ONLY, CUSTOMER SUPPLYING PARTS. Bid labor only. Do not include parts in the price and do not bring parts.")
B.a86=s(["Ask the customer for the part numbers if you want to check them before you go.","On arrival, check the parts are the right ones and are ready.","If the parts are wrong, take a clear photo of the part, then you can cancel for customer fault (a note of at least 10 characters is required). You receive 20% of the job price, shared as described in 'How payouts work'.","If the parts are not ready or nobody is there after you have waited 10 minutes, you can cancel the same way."],t.s)
B.W1=new A.dj(B.a86)
B.Zu=new A.hx("Only cancel for these reasons if they are true. You must have a verified arrival, and the photo and note are kept as evidence.")
B.a51=s([B.Yk,B.W1,B.Zu],t.f)
B.UJ=new A.b9("m-bidding-laboronly","Labor-only jobs: how to bid","The customer supplies the parts. Quote labor only.",B.a51)
B.Xc=new A.aZ("Bid the realistic hours the diagnosis takes and your honest hourly rate. Once accepted, the hours and price are fixed. You cannot add time later.")
B.YC=new A.aZ("Be clear in your note about what is included, for example scan, inspection or test drive.")
B.a8L=s([B.Xc,B.YC],t.f)
B.Vp=new A.b9("m-bidding-diag","Bidding on diagnostics","Hours x rate. No add-ons.",B.a8L)
B.XS=new A.aZ("All payments for jobs found on YCYC must go through YCYC. Do not accept or ask for cash, transfers or payment apps for a job that came from the platform, and do not take the customer off the platform to avoid fees.")
B.Xk=new A.aZ("This protects both of you: it keeps a record, and it keeps your payment secured. Breaking this rule can lead to removal and held payouts.")
B.a6F=s([B.XS,B.Xk],t.f)
B.Vn=new A.b9("m-bidding-offapp","Keep everything on YCYC","No cash, no side deals.",B.a6F)
B.a89=s(["Bid only on work you are qualified and equipped to do safely.","Check that you can make the arrival time you promise.","You are responsible for any licenses, permits and insurance your work needs.","If you cannot do the job after all, tell the customer and cancel early, before they are inconvenienced."],t.s)
B.W3=new A.dj(B.a89)
B.a5E=s([B.W3],t.f)
B.UR=new A.b9("m-bidding-only","Only bid on what you can do","Skill, tools, time, and licensing.",B.a5E)
