B.Ze=new A.fT("Bidding rules","Honest bids only",B.a_s,B.a4N)
B.a6u=s(["Clear description: a good job lists symptoms, when it started and what has been tried. Photos help.","Matches your skills, tools and parts access.","Distance and timing make sense. Check the zip code and travel time.","Price is realistic. You can do it safely and still earn a fair rate after YCYC's 15% fee.","Check the flags: Labor quote only, diagnostic needed, Dealer quote, and so on.","Does the vehicle look suitable for a mobile job? Heavy work may need a shop."],t.s)
B.W8=new A.dj(B.a6u)
B.WZ=new A.dM("If a job is vague, bid a diagnostic first or say clearly in your note what is included.")
B.a4V=s([B.W8,B.WZ],t.f)
B.UX=new A.b9("m-choose-job","How to choose a good job","A quick checklist before you bid.",B.a4V)
B.XV=new A.aZ("On each job you see a customer label: either a rating like '4.8 (12 reviews)' or 'New customer'.")
B.a9_=s(["A good rating from several mechanics is a good sign.","A new customer is not a bad sign. Everyone starts somewhere. Be clear and keep everything in the app.","Customers who describe the problem clearly and respond quickly are usually easier to work with.","Be careful with anyone who wants cash, off-app payment or work before approval."],t.s)
B.Wo=new A.dj(B.a9_)
