B.VJ=new A.b9("m-payouts-fee","The 15% fee","YCYC keeps 15% of the job price. You keep the rest.",B.a4R)
B.a5J=s(["The customer's card is held when they accept your bid and pay.","After the work is done, the customer confirms and releases payment. The money is captured.","Your share goes to your Stripe account. Stripe then pays out to your bank or debit card on your payout schedule."],t.s)
B.YT=new A.hc(B.a5J)
B.Yq=new A.aZ("Bank timing is set by Stripe and your bank, usually a few business days. Check your Earnings screen for the status of each job.")
B.X8=new A.dM("If a customer neither confirms nor reports a problem, the hold can be released to you automatically before the card authorization expires (often about seven days).")
B.a5w=s([B.YT,B.Yq,B.X8],t.f)
B.Ux=new A.b9("m-payouts-timing","When you get paid","Hold, capture, then Stripe pays you.",B.a5w)
B.Yd=new A.aZ("If you have an eligible debit card on Stripe, you can cash out available funds instantly. The fee is 3% of the amount cashed out, with a minimum of 1 dollar. The exact fee and what you will receive are shown in the app before you confirm. Standard payouts to your bank on Stripe's normal schedule have no instant cash-out fee.")
B.X_=new A.dM("Eligibility depends on Stripe and your card. Not all cards support instant payouts.")
