B.UP=new A.b9("m-payouts-instant","Instant cash-out","Get paid in minutes for a small fee.",B.a5m)
B.a7n=s(["Customer cancels after paying, before work started: 20% of the amount held is the cancellation fee. YCYC takes its usual share and you receive the rest.","Customer cancels after work started: 50% fee, shared the same way.","Customer-fault cancellation by you (wrong parts, parts not ready, or the customer not there or not responding 10 minutes after your arrival): 20% of the job price, of which YCYC keeps 5% and you receive 15%.","Reschedule approved by you: 20% (you have arrived), 10% (you are on the way), 5% (not set off) of the job price. YCYC keeps its 5% in the arrival and on-the-way cases.","You cancel, or you do not show up: no fee, and the customer is not charged."],t.s)
B.W7=new A.dj(B.a7n)
B.a3H=s([B.W7],t.f)
B.VQ=new A.b9("m-payouts-cancel","Payouts when a job is cancelled or rescheduled","Who gets what.",B.a3H)
B.Ya=new A.aZ("If YCYC decides after review to refund a customer in full or part, the refunded amount is not paid to you, or may be recovered from your future payouts if it was already paid. A bank dispute that the customer wins has the same effect.")
B.XT=new A.aZ("Good records protect you: photos, notes, check-ins and the customer's confirmation.")
B.a8T=s([B.Ya,B.XT],t.f)
B.UB=new A.b9("m-payouts-refunds","Refunds and reversals","What happens if the customer is refunded or disputes.",B.a8T)
B.XH=new A.aZ("You are responsible for your own taxes. Stripe may send you tax forms such as a 1099 if you meet the thresholds. Keep your own records of your income.")
