B.a6G=s(["Verified: YCYC has reviewed the mechanic's details before they could bid. It is not an endorsement of any particular repair.","ASE certified: one or more ASE certificates were uploaded and approved by YCYC. Check which ones.","Insurance: the mechanic uploaded proof of insurance that YCYC reviewed, and it has not expired. It is not a guarantee of coverage for your job.","Mobile service, Shop, Warranty offered, Accepts insurance jobs: what the mechanic says they offer."],t.s)
