B.Z8=new A.fT("Choosing a mechanic","General tips. The choice is always yours.",B.lM,B.a6x)
B.YG=new A.aZ("You pay the job price you accepted plus YCYC's service fee of 5% of the job price. The total is shown before you confirm.")
B.Xp=new A.aZ("Example: a 200 dollar job has a 10 dollar service fee, so your card is held for 210 dollars.")
