B.Vf=new A.b9("c-pay-fees","What you pay","The bid, plus a 5% service fee.",B.a4h)
B.XA=new A.aZ("When you accept a bid and pay, your card is authorized: the money is set aside but not paid out. It may show as pending. It is captured and paid out when you confirm the job is complete, when YCYC releases it after reviewing a problem, or automatically if the authorization is about to expire without a confirmation or a reported problem.")
B.Xz=new A.aZ("If a job is cancelled, only any applicable fee is captured and the rest of the hold is released back to your card. How fast your bank shows the release depends on your bank.")
B.a8F=s([B.XA,B.Xz],t.f)
B.VL=new A.b9("c-pay-hold","Hold vs charge","Your card is held first and charged when the job is done.",B.a8F)
B.a4L=s(["Cancel before paying: no fee.","Cancel after paying, before work started: 20% of the amount held.","Cancel after you both confirmed work started: 50%.","Reschedule: 20% (mechanic arrived), 10% (on the way), 5% (not set off), of the job price, only if the mechanic approves.","Labor-only job cancelled by the mechanic for wrong or missing parts, or no one there: 20% of the job price.","Mechanic cancels or never shows up: you are not charged."],t.s)
