B.ajr=new A.fk(2,B.wS,"Why we exist","Car repair shouldn't be a black box. Too many drivers get overcharged or talked into work they didn't ask for, with nowhere else to turn. YCYC puts that choice back in your hands.",!1,null)
B.ajs=new A.fk(1,B.xc,"Describe what's happening","Tell us about the symptoms. The more detail, the better the bids.",!1,null)
