B.ajw=new A.fk(4,B.eh,"The mechanic comes and diagnoses","Same arrival steps as any YCYC job.",!1,null)
B.ajx=new A.fk(1,B.fw,"What YCYC is","\"Your Car, Your Choice\" is a marketplace where independent, local mechanics compete for your repair job by bidding on it \u2014 you're never stuck with a single shop's price.",!1,null)
B.ajy=new A.fk(5,B.jj,"You get the diagnosis in writing","It shows up in the app, and we let you know.",!1,null)
B.ajz=new A.fk(3,B.pY,"Built by a mechanic","YCYC was founded by a former mechanic who has spent years teaching people in underserved neighborhoods how to work on their own cars \u2014 this app runs on that same idea: give people real options and straight answers.",!1,null)
